text: ['Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all lands.', 'Flash\\nWhen Dualcaster Mage enters the battlefield, copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Take an extra turn after this one.', "{2}{R}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of target creature card in your graveyard, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Tap target land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.']
flavor: ['"It has been my experience that disasters like to strike in pairs."', '"She will come back to me."', '"Thorn bushes spring up wherever the army has passed. Lean years follow in the wake of a great war."\\n—Lao Tzu, *Tao Te Ching*,\\ntrans. Feng and English', "Doing something at the last minute isn't so bad when you can make that minute last.", 'Rishada is the gateway to free trade—but the key will cost you.', 'The land was left depleted and empty, an unsettling taste of things to come.']
artist: ['Chase Stone', 'Fang Yue', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Izzy', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Kev Walker', 'Matt Stewart', 'Steven Belledin']
